 7 in Arlington\, Virginia (venue not named). Original research abstracts 
 (max 400 words\, Introduction/Methods/Results/Conclusion) are accepted fr
 om November 16\, 2026 (day only) to February 17\, 2027\, 1:00 PM Central\
 ; notifications are expected mid-March 2027. The closed Call for Proposal
 s gathered speaker and session ideas. The 2027 call says abstracts are bl
 ind-reviewed by the Steering Committee for 7-10 minute oral talks or pape
 r posters. Titles and author details are published in meeting materials\;
  no proceedings are stated. Previously published abstracts or articles ar
 e not eligible\, but preprints are. 2025 was June 12-14 in Arlington. Bil
 led as biennial (2012\, 2014 and 2016 editions are documented)\, but NANS
 's recent editions were 2021 and 2025. Size M reflects a three-day hotel 
 meeting with poster receptions\; no attendance is published. Size is an e
 ditorial estimate.
