 ision Making\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-11-14\nOfficial source: ht
 tps://rldm.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#rldm
 -2027\nNotes: Official rldm.org pages give July 6-9\, 2027 at Maison de l
 a Chimie\, Paris (seventh meeting after 2013-2025)\, with submissions due
  January 20\, 2027 AoE and decisions February 26 AoE. A submission is a s
 ummary (max 2\,000 characters) plus a 1-4 page extended abstract\, single
 -blind\, for posters or oral talks. Non-archival\, no proceedings\; autho
 rs choose whether the extended abstract enters the electronic booklet\, a
 nd work submitted elsewhere is welcome. On 2026-11-14 the abstract portal
  link still read 'coming soon'. A half-day workshop call (about five work
 shops) is due January 8\, 2027\, 23:59 UTC\, with decisions by February 1
 4\; no tutorial call is published. Irregular cadence (2013-2019 biennial\
 , then 2022\, 2025). No attendance counts\; 2025 was single-track with th
 ree poster sessions. Size is an editorial estimate.
